            <h3>Connecting business needs with thoughtful technology.</h3>
            <p>I am a final-year Bachelor of Commerce student specialising in Information Systems and Technology at the University of KwaZulu-Natal. My interests include Software Development, System Analysis and Design, software architecture and Solutions Architecture.</p>
            <p>I enjoy understanding business problems and translating them into structured system requirements, database designs and practical technology solutions. My experience includes academic software projects and contributing to the early development of a startup technology product.</p>
            <p>My immediate goal is to become a Software Engineer, building strong practical experience in designing and implementing reliable systems. Long term, I aim to become a Solutions Architect who understands a business’s strategy, challenges, and goals, then develops technology strategies, designs suitable solutions, and works with teams to implement them.</p>
